<title>CHINA: China Luthai B shares in strong debut.</title>
<headline>China Luthai B shares in strong debut.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Luthai Textile Joint Stock Co Ltd's B shares opened at HK$2.35 on their trading debut in Shenzhen, up from their offer price of HK$1.93.</p>
</text>
